A formula has an implied intercept term. To remove this use either y ~ x - 1
 or y ~ 0 + x. See
formula<http://127.0.0.1:31663/library/stats/help/formula> for
more details of allowed formulae.

ou seja
lm(y~x-1)

use ?lm e olha a documentação de formula para maiores detalhes...

