DataFrame 1 -->
   snp1 snp2 snp3 snp4
1     A    A    C    T
2     A    G    T    G
3     A    G    C    G
4     A    A    C    T
5     T    G    T    T

DataFrame 2 -->
   snp       anc
1 snp1         A
2 snp2         G
3 snp3         C
4 snp4         T

E o que eu preciso ter:
Dataframe final -->
   snp1 snp2 snp3 snp4
1     0    1    0    0
2     0    0    1    1
3     0    0    0    1
4     0    1    0    0
